Text Notes 800 3600 0 75 ~ 0
U1.4 PHI0 -> U4.5/6 -> U4.9/8 -> U1.26 PHI2. Do not attach the POKEY 1-MHz clock to TIA.
Text Notes 800 10000 0 75 ~ 0
R40/C27 delay the PHI2 falling edge before U5/U6 sample REQ. Measure PHI2 Low >=400 ns and select timing.
Text Notes 800 10300 0 75 ~ 0
Two request synchronizer stages plus edge detector and NAND are reused. One selected bus cycle per REQ rising edge.
Text Notes 800 10600 0 75 ~ 0
TIA numeric setup/hold limits and UMC-specific DC limits were not found. Timing acceptance targets are design assumptions.
$EndSCHEMATC
